6. Modify /var/www/html/property-app/lib/screens/seller/seller_dashboard.dart to add two new popup menu options in `_propertyTile`'s `PopupMenuButton`. After the existing 'delete' option add:
  ```dart
  const PopupMenuItem(value: 'images', child: ListTile(dense: true, leading: Icon(Icons.photo_library_outlined, size: 18), title: Text('Manage Photos'))),
  const PopupMenuItem(value: 'documents', child: ListTile(dense: true, leading: Icon(Icons.description_outlined, size: 18), title: Text('Legal Documents'))),
  ```
  In the `onSelected` handler add:
  ```dart
  if (v == 'images') showModalBottomSheet(context: context, isScrollControlled: true, backgroundColor: Colors.white, shape: const RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.vertical(top: Radius.circular(kRadL))), builder: (_) => ManageImagesSheet(property: p));
  if (v == 'documents') showModalBottomSheet(context: context, isScrollControlled: true, backgroundColor: Colors.white, shape: const RoundedRectangleBorder(borderRadius: BorderRadius.vertical(top: Radius.circular(kRadL))), builder: (_) => ManageDocumentsSheet(propertyId: p.id, propertyTitle: p.title));
  ```
  Add imports at top of file:
  ```dart
  import 'manage_images_sheet.dart';
  import 'manage_documents_sheet.dart';
  ```
